& [ConstraintLedger] preserves the non-waivable rules
  + [C1] only caller-admitted FieldElement identities may occur in model-derived records
  + [C2] FieldElement identity content and digest remain immutable through the cycle
  + [C3] field order may vary but membership may not
  + [C4] every model output remains proposal until host validation
  + [C5] agreement is exact over sorted candidate member identities rather than prose similarity
  + [C6] at least three of four unique order probes must support a candidate
  + [C7] Delineation must preserve every candidate identity and construct explicit typed relations over admitted endpoints
  + [C8] delineation support must connect and cover all candidate members
  + [C9] a hard boundary contradiction identity remap unknown ID blocking contradiction or unresolved item rejects latch
  + [C10] latch means admitted_for_attention under one field purpose and source digest not factual truth
  + [C11] all provider prompts responses validation results and decisions are sanitized and replayable
  + [C12] live execution is read-only and leaves llama.cpp unchanged

