& [JustificationReview] supports the selected form
  + [claim] is separate model proposal from deterministic admission
  + [support] is SAIL distinction between inference and effects plus semantic-fabric activation-versus-truth boundary
  + [claim] is vary presentation order before accepting whole-field convergence
  + [support] is order variation is a cheap falsification of serial prompt anchoring while exact ID aggregation remains inspectable
